### 1. LOGIN (Get JWT Token)
# Use this block to log in and capture the token.
# Other roles you can use: receptionist_john, nurse_mary, doctor_mike, lab_tech_sam, pharmacist_jane, cashier_lucy (password is 'password' for all)

# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### Set Token Variable (Automatic if using VS Code REST Client extension)
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. RECEPTIONIST APIs
# Get today's visits
GET http://localhost:8080/api/receptionist/todays-visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. NURSE APIs
# Get Triange Queue
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nurse/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. DOCTOR APIs
# Get Consultation Queue
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctor/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. LAB APIs
# Get Pending Lab Requests
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lab/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. PHARMACY APIs
# Get Pending Prescriptions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pharmacy/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. CASHIER APIs
# Get All Invoices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cashier/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. ADMIN / ANALYTICS APIs
# Get Visit Volume Analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/analytics/visit-volume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Medical Records History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/history/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
